    "body": "<!-- Based on https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/blob/master/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.md -->\r\n<!-- Please don't delete this template or we'll close your issue -->\r\n<!-- Before creating an issue please make sure you are using the latest version of Statusfy. -->\r\n\r\n## Feature request\r\n\r\n- [x] I confirm that this is a feature request rather than a question.\r\n\r\n<!-- Please ask questions via following several ways. -->\r\n<!-- Free Support (Spectrum Chat): https://spectrum.chat/bazzite/statusfy -->\r\n<!-- Professional Support: This project is sponsored by https://www.bazzite.com. If you require Professional Assistance on your project(s), please contact us at https://statusfy.co/support. -->\r\n\r\n<!-- Issues which contain questions or support requests will be closed. -->\r\n\r\n#### What problem does this feature solve?\r\n\r\nAny company from the EU has to put a link to their \"Data Privacy Statement\" on every website/webpage they publish.\r\nEspecially in Germany we have to also put a \"Legal Notice\" on all our websites.\r\n\r\nA footer should look like so:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1034\" alt=\"footer-en\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/12599965/63653589-1474b180-c76f-11e9-8868-11161bda7e68.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\n#### What does the proposed API look like?\r\n\r\nWe add additional keys to the config for links\r\n\r\n```\r\n  theme: {\r\n    links: {\r\n      en: {\r\n        contact: \"https://statusfy.co/support\",\r\n        support: \"https://statusfy.co/support\",\r\n        home: \"https://statusfy.co\",\r\n        privacy: \"https://statusfy.co/data-privacy\",\r\n        legal: \"https://statusfy.co/legal\"\r\n      },\r\n      es: {\r\n        contact: \"https://statusfy.co/es/support\",\r\n        support: \"https://statusfy.co/es/support\",\r\n        home: \"https://statusfy.co/es\",\r\n        privacy: \"https://statusfy.co/es/data-privacy\",\r\n        legal: \"https://statusfy.co/es/legal\"\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### How should this be implemented in your opinion?\r\n\r\nSimply by adding the keys as allowed keys to the `Footer.vue` and adding translations to the translation files.\r\n\r\n#### Are you willing to work on this yourself?**\r\n\r\nYes. Here is my PR: https://github.com/bazzite/statusfy/pull/357",
